{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_012TdbQcmYTcxh4amaovkiPT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"跨架构证据被视为 robust generalization，exit collapse 的 VLM→VLA 二元分离被接受为 novel mechanistic insight，框架贡献被认可为可复用方法论\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"A1: 3 架构 × 4 suite 的跨架构矩阵被视为充分覆盖（reviewers 不要求第 4 种架构或非 LIBERO 环境）\"\n      - \"A2: R² exit collapse 的 6/6 vs 0/4 二元分离被接受为 clean finding，Δ>0.10 阈值不被视为 arbitrary\"\n      - \"A3: CF sensitivity 的 metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后接受——OpenVLA 的 within-metric 对比 (d trained > d untrained) 作为 fair evidence 足够\"\n      - \"A4: 缺乏 behavioral/closed-loop 验证不被视为 fatal flaw——representational analysis 本身有价值\"\n      - \"A5: L1 head count 的 base-model-dependent 解读被视为 honest science 而非 weakness（区分 what training creates vs inherits）\"\n      - \"A6: NLP finetuning control (ΔR²=0.000) 被视为 strong evidence 排除 generic fine-tuning artifact\"\n    number_ranges:\n      reviewer_avg_score: [6.5, 7.5]  # CoRL 1-10 scale\n      strong_reject_count: [0, 0]\n      accept_probability: [0.55, 0.75]\n      claims_surviving_without_qualification: [2.5, 3]  # out of C1+C2+C3\n      rebuttal_success_if_borderline: [0.7, 0.9]\n      exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance: [0.85, 1.0]  # fraction of reviewers accepting the finding\n      cf_sensitivity_reviewer_acceptance: [0.7, 0.9]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始 framing 完全成立。Title/abstract 保持 \"cross-architecture analysis reveals\n      deliberate instruction routing in VLAs\"。C2 的三层级路由梯度作为 headline finding，\n      exit collapse 的 VLM→VLA one-time reorganization 作为 mechanistic insight，\n      NLP control 作为 specificity evidence。C1 框架的跨架构适用性作为 methodological contribution\n      被独立 valued。C3 作为 observation 不受挑战。论文叙事：routing 是 VLA 训练的 emergent property，\n      本文首次系统表征其跨架构一致性。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"核心发现（exit collapse + routing gradient）被接受但 CF sensitivity 因 metric incomparability 被质疑，1-2 位 reviewer 要求 behavioral validation，需要在 rebuttal 中调整 claim 强度\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"A1 holds: 跨架构覆盖被接受\"\n      - \"A2 partially: exit collapse 被接受但 1 位 reviewer 认为 Δ>0.10 阈值需要 principled justification\"\n      - \"A3 fails: CF metric incomparability 被 1-2 位 reviewer 视为 serious limitation——TracVLA/NORA 的 trained (Cohen's d) vs untrained (cosine dist) 无法直接比较，仅 OpenVLA 可做 fair comparison 且 gap 适中 (Δ=0.04-0.24)\"\n      - \"A4 partially fails: 至少 1 位 reviewer 明确要求 behavioral evidence 或 closed-loop 验证\"\n      - \"A5 holds: L1 base-model-dependent 解读被接受\"\n      - \"A7 challenged: 'so what for practitioners' 被认为 insufficiently answered——routing insight 尚未转化为 actionable design guidance\"\n    number_ranges:\n      reviewer_avg_score: [5.5, 6.5]\n      strong_reject_count: [0, 1]\n      accept_probability: [0.25, 0.50]\n      claims_surviving_without_qualification: [1.5, 2.5]\n      rebuttal_success_if_borderline: [0.4, 0.6]\n      exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance: [0.65, 0.85]\n      cf_sensitivity_reviewer_acceptance: [0.3, 0.6]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      C2 需要分层呈现。Exit collapse + routing gradient 保持为 core findings，但 CF sensitivity\n      降为 \"supporting evidence with caveats\"——明确承认 metric incomparability 限制了\n      trained-vs-untrained amplification 的定量化。仅 report OpenVLA 的 within-metric\n      comparison 作为 \"fair\" evidence，TracVLA/NORA 仅报告 trained model 的 absolute CF magnitude\n      (d≥0.45)。Rebuttal 策略：(1) 补充 Δ>0.10 阈值的 sensitivity analysis（0.05/0.10/0.15\n      三个阈值下 pattern 是否稳定），(2) 对 behavioral gap 诚实回应——\"representational analysis\n      is a necessary first step; behavioral validation is orthogonal and requires different\n      experimental infrastructure\"，(3) 强化 NLP control 的 specificity argument。\n      Abstract 调整：将 CF 从 \"core finding\" 改为 \"consistent observation\"，headline 聚焦\n      exit collapse 的 VLM→VLA transition specificity。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"Reviewers 认为 exit collapse 是 trivially expected（VLM→VLA 当然改变表征），CF 无 behavioral grounding 缺乏 functional significance，论文被视为 descriptive analysis without actionable insight——需要彻底 reframe 但不降级 venue\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"A2 fails conceptually: exit collapse 被视为 'of course representations change when you add action training'——VLM→VLA 二元性被认为是 trivial observation 而非 mechanistic insight\"\n      - \"A3 fails completely: CF sensitivity 被 2+ reviewers 视为 'representational perturbation without functional consequence'——没有 behavioral evidence 证明 routing perturbation 影响 task performance\"\n      - \"A4 fails: 'pure representational analysis' 在 CoRL（robotics venue）被认为 insufficient——reviewers 期望 at minimum closed-loop ablation 或 design intervention\"\n      - \"A7 fails: practical implications 被视为 speculative——'optimize entry-exit routing' 没有具体 how\"\n      - \"A1 partially holds: 跨架构是 thorough engineering 但 'consistency of a trivial effect across architectures is not a contribution'\"\n      - \"OpenVLA 不展示 exit collapse 被反过来论证为 finding 的 non-universality 而非 clean binary\"\n    number_ranges:\n      reviewer_avg_score: [4.0, 5.5]\n      strong_reject_count: [1, 2]\n      accept_probability: [0.05, 0.20]\n      claims_surviving_without_qualification: [0.5, 1.5]\n      rebuttal_success_if_borderline: [0.15, 0.35]\n      exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance: [0.3, 0.55]\n      cf_sensitivity_reviewer_acceptance: [0.1, 0.3]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      需要彻底 reframe，但仍冲 CoRL 2026（rebuttal 或 camera-ready 调整）。新 angle：\n      从 \"discovering routing mechanisms\" 转为 \"diagnostic methodology for VLA development\"。\n      核心 pitch 变为：本文提供第一个系统化的 VLA representational profiling toolkit，\n      跨 3 架构验证，可用于 (1) 判断 VLA 是否完成了 VLM→VLA transition（exit collapse 作为 binary diagnostic），\n      (2) 比较不同 pretraining strategies 的 representational footprint（routing gradient 作为 comparison framework），\n      (3) 检测 base model 贡献 vs training 贡献（L1 head count vs R² collapse 分离）。\n      C2 从 \"mechanistic insight\" 降为 \"empirical characterization\"，C1 的 framework 升级为\n      primary contribution。Exit collapse 重新定义为 \"diagnostic signature\" 而非 \"mechanistic finding\"。\n      Abstract 重写：开头不再是 \"how does training reshape routing\" 而是 \"practitioners lack tools\n      to understand what VLA training actually changes\"——motivation 从 understanding 转为 tooling。\n      补充 rebuttal material：(1) 将 three-tier gradient 包装为 concrete recommendation\n      （选择 pretraining checkpoint 时用 exit collapse presence 作为 indicator），\n      (2) 引用 representation engineering 文献论证 representational analysis 的独立价值\n      （不需要 behavioral validation 才能成立）。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":53079,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":53079},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"071f18f8-f5ad-4361-b8d4-838bb05ab659","uuid":"999998d5-6c8a-4fd5-a50d-bc19c88c4e48"}
